{
  "title": "Network ACL · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "Subnet 경계의 상태 비저장 허용·거부 규칙이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Network ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#rule-number-and-first-match\">Rule Number and First Match</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#allow-and-deny\">Allow and Deny</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#inbound-and-outbound\">Inbound and Outbound</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#ephemeral-ports\">Ephemeral Ports</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#default-and-custom-network-acl\">Default and Custom Network ACL</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#network-acl-and-security-group\">Network ACL and Security Group</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>34 / 62</span></div><h1>Network ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 6 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Network ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span>은 Subnet으로 들어오고 나가는 트래픽에 적용되는 Stateless 필터다. 번호가 낮은 규칙부터 평가하여 처음 일치한 Allow 또는 Deny를 적용한다.</p><p>같은 요청이라도 응답은 별도로 평가된다. Inbound만 허용하고 응답에 필요한 Outbound Port를 막으면 연결이 성립하지 않아 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a> 설정이 정상이어도 통신이 실패한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Stateless 양방향 규칙\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Stateless 양방향 규칙</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Inbound</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Client → TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span> 443</strong><small>Subnet으로 들어오는 요청</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Numbered rules</strong><small>낮은 번호부터 첫 Match</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Allow / Deny</strong><small>명시적 Deny 지원</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Outbound response</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Server response</strong><small>Client의 Ephemeral Port 대상</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#outbound-rules\">Outbound rules</a></strong><small>응답도 별도 평가</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Allow / Deny</strong><small>Inbound 허용만으로 충분하지 않음</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Network ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span>은 Subnet 경계이며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>과 함께 통과해야 한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"rule-number-and-first-match\"><h2>Rule Number and First Match<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#rule-number-and-first-match\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>작은 Rule Number가 먼저 적용된다. 넓은 Allow가 먼저 일치하면 뒤의 좁은 Deny까지 도달하지 않는다. 규칙 우선순위를 설계하고 마지막 기본 거부를 포함한 전체 평가 순서를 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"allow-and-deny\"><h2>Allow and Deny<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#allow-and-deny\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>과 달리 명시적 Deny를 제공한다. 특정 악성 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>을 Subnet 경계에서 차단할 때 사용할 수 있다. HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> Header나 SQL Injection 같은 애플리케이션 내용은 이 규칙이 분석하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"inbound-and-outbound\"><h2>Inbound and Outbound<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#inbound-and-outbound\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>방향별 규칙은 서로 독립적이다. Source와 Destination의 개념도 방향에 따라 바뀐다. 요청과 응답을 둘 다 허용해야 하므로 단순히 서비스 Listen Port 하나만 넣는 것으로 부족할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"ephemeral-ports\"><h2>Ephemeral Ports<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#ephemeral-ports\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span> Client가 사용하는 임시 Port로 응답이 돌아온다. OS와 Client 유형에 따라 범위가 다르므로 실제 환경에 맞는 반환 Port를 열어야 한다. 일반적인 넓은 임시 Port 범위 허용은 적용 경계와 보안 요구를 함께 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"default-and-custom-network-acl\"><h2>Default and Custom Network ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#default-and-custom-network-acl\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Default Network ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span>은 초기 Allow 규칙을 제공한다. 새 Custom Network ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span>은 규칙을 추가하기 전 기본 거부 상태다. Subnet은 한 Network ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span>을 사용하며 한 ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span>을 여러 Subnet에 연결할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"network-acl-and-security-group\"><h2>Network ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span> and Security Group<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#network-acl-and-security-group\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Network ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span>은 Subnet 경계의 번호 기반 Stateless 필터, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>은 리소스의 Stateful Allow 정책이다. 둘 중 하나라도 차단하면 통신하지 못한다. ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span>을 사용했다고 리소스별 최소 권한 정책을 생략하지 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>외부 HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span> 요청을 허용한 웹 Subnet에서 응답이 실패한다면 Outbound Ephemeral Port와 반대편 Return Route를 확인한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>응답 패킷까지 별도의 방향 규칙이 필요하다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/vpc-network-acls.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vpc/latest/userguide/vpc-network-acls.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q014/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q014\" data-question=\"Q014\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q014</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q014/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to explicitly deny traffic from a source IP range across an entire subnet. Which control should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q014\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A deny rule in a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q014\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q014\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A deny rule in a security group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q014\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI attribute</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a> 수준에서 명시적 거부를 지원하며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>는 허용 규칙만 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">Network ACL</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q015\" data-question=\"Q015\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q015</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q015/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A custom network ACL allows inbound TCP port 443, but return traffic is blocked. What should be checked?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q015\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The S3 bucket name</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q015\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The CloudTrail retention period</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q015\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Outbound network ACL rules for the response port range</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q015\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The AMI&#x27;s Region</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a>은 상태 비저장이므로 응답 방향도 허용해야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">Network ACL</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q009\" data-question=\"Q009\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q009</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a public subnet must receive requests directly from internet clients. Which combination is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only an S3 gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a route to a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A route to an internet gateway, a public address, and permissive security rules</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a private IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>로 향하는 경로와 외부에서 도달할 주소, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>/<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a> 허용이 함께 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q008\" data-question=\"Q008\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q008</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q008/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A route table has 10.0.0.0/16 to a peering connection and 10.0.1.0/24 to a local target. Which principle determines the route for 10.0.1.25?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Shortest prefix match</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The route created first</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compare only the last octet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Longest prefix match</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 목적지 전체 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>을 비교해 더 구체적인 일치 경로를 우선한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q006\" data-question=\"Q006\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q006</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q006/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which IP address falls within the 10.0.1.0/24 CIDR block?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q006\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.2.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q006\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.1.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q006\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">10.1.1.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q006\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.0.124</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · /24는 앞 24비트, 곧 이 예시의 10.0.1이 같아야 한다. AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 예약 주소 여부도 별도로 확인한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">이전 용어 <b>NAT Gateway</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">다음 용어 <b>Object / File / Block</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
